  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "e00fba6fedfb8a49e13346f7099a23fc",
        "content": [
          "A lapsed member is one with no purchase in the last 90 days (lapsed_90d = TRUE in gold_member_360, or the Lapsed dimension in loyalty_member_metrics).For rates and totals about members (lapse rate, spend, lapsed revenue) use loyalty_member_metrics with MEASURE(). For monthly trends use loyalty_activity_metrics. For model risk, revenue at risk and drivers use retention_risk_metrics.Revenue at risk means SUM(annual_value_at_risk) from member_retention_scores (spend_12m x p_lapse). Never sum spend_12m alone and call it revenue at risk.Risk bands: High means p_lapse >= 0.60, Medium 0.35 to 0.60, Low below 0.35.When asked for a list of specific members or who to contact, query member_retention_scores and return member_id, tier, p_lapse, primary_driver, recommended_action, annual_value_at_risk ordered by annual_value_at_risk DESC, limited to 50 rows.The birthday reward was cut from $20 to $10 on 2026-07-15. The Core Denim fit change happened on 2026-06-01. Mention these when a trend question spans those dates.Metric view measures must be queried with MEASURE(`name`) and GROUP BY the dimensions; never apply SUM or AVG around MEASURE().Store formats are online, mall, strip and outlet. Tiers are Bronze, Silver, Gold. Regions are West, Southwest, Midwest, Southeast, Northeast."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "example_question_sqls": [
      {
        "id": "0f82517362f25415455bbb5e8775759c",
        "question": [
          "How much revenue is at risk by risk band and primary driver?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT `Risk Band`, `Primary Driver`, MEASURE(`Scored Members`) AS members, MEASURE(`Revenue at Risk`) AS revenue_at_risk FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.retention_risk_metrics GROUP BY `Risk Band`, `Primary Driver` ORDER BY revenue_at_risk DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "282704d4ecaefe59cfa0634fd7d5db40",
        "question": [
          "Show monthly active buyers and fit return share for 2026"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT `Activity Month`, MEASURE(`Active Buyers`) AS active_buyers, MEASURE(`Fit Return Share`) AS fit_return_share FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.loyalty_activity_metrics WHERE `Activity Month` >= '2026-01-01' GROUP BY `Activity Month` ORDER BY `Activity Month`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "82df53c3f9f2b18244a3dcdbc4222c9a",
        "question": [
          "How much lapsed spend do we have by home store format?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT `Home Store Format`, MEASURE(`Lapsed Members`) AS lapsed_members, MEASURE(`Lapsed Spend 12M`) AS lapsed_spend_12m FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.loyalty_member_metrics GROUP BY `Home Store Format` ORDER BY lapsed_spend_12m DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "a399aa5fae18a56e29dc03c6e77324d3",
        "question": [
          "Did the birthday reward response rate change after July 2026?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT CASE WHEN `Activity Month` >= '2026-08-01' THEN 'after cut' ELSE 'before cut' END AS period, MEASURE(`Campaign Response Rate`) AS response_rate FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.loyalty_activity_metrics WHERE `Activity Month` >= '2026-01-01' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "cb5400e9843c1543ccfd276a72f65bce",
        "question": [
          "What is our lapse rate by tier?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT `Tier`, MEASURE(`Members`) AS members, MEASURE(`Lapse Rate`) AS lapse_rate FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.loyalty_member_metrics GROUP BY `Tier` ORDER BY lapse_rate DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d26c797081ac1f4cb9df77f43944436d",
        "question": [
          "Which Gold members in mall stores are at high risk?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT member_id, tier, p_lapse, primary_driver, recommended_action, annual_value_at_risk FROM loyalty_lapse_demo_catalog.loyalty.member_retention_scores WHERE risk_band = 'High' AND tier = 'Gold' AND home_store_format = 'mall' ORDER BY annual_value_at_risk DESC LIMIT 50"
        ]
      }
    ]
